Mapping \code{smut}, \code{western_bean_cutworm} or \code{unpollinated} adds a legend by default, with a
mini cob for 0, 25, 50, 75 and 100\%. To hide them:

\if{html}{\out{<div class="sourceCode r">}}\preformatted{# hide one legend
